does not publish a Buzz fork. Configuration emitted by waggle (persona packs,
workflow YAML, deploy manifests) is original work of the waggle contributors.

When a Buzz source tree is present under `vendor/buzz`, its Apache-2.0 NOTICE
and LICENSE apply to that tree.

